{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u25c6\u00a0</i>Please note: Multiple AMD users have reported game stuttering. Workaround: Disable AMD's anti-lag feature</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951430/extras/73d884ead8152ef07fa5bbcc6c9f53e2.avif?t=1760976906\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6Defeat enemies to obtain equipment and runes of different color qualities. The entries and values of the equipment change randomly. Among them, purple equipment is the rarest, with 4 entries and the highest value multiplier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951430/extras/03d5810b717ace78657f4ce4f1ea74b2.avif?t=1760976906\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6Equipment can be enhanced and upgraded at merchants, with each piece of equipment being enhanced up to 10 times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951430/extras/465e1565deb2c2c413576ade375661aa.avif?t=1760976906\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6Runes are used to craft rune word equipment, which is the most powerful type of equipment in the game and brings a huge leap in the character's strength.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Graphics Card Monster","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3951430/15cdc5fde9e0372887f77499ee0311fe3a17cc70.jpg"},{"name":"Insect King","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3951430/35ff790c310